VectorCraft Swift

The native Swift implementation is licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0, as stated in
LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE in this directory.

The workspace includes native PDF versions of VectorCraft's existing vector icons.
Lucide-derived glyphs retain their ISC/Feather MIT license in
Sources/VectorCraftMac/Resources/Icons/LICENSE-lucide.txt. Original dc-* glyphs
remain MIT OR Apache-2.0. Source and derived paths are listed in ASSETS.md.

Source Sans 3 Regular and Semibold are optional external build inputs, licensed
under SIL Open Font License 1.1. Font binaries are not part of this source package;
when supplied, their OFL text is included in the app alongside the fonts.
SF Symbols are supplied by macOS.

Naftali's local build may use the existing Vectorify app icon by explicit local-use
permission. Its original creator and redistribution license remain unestablished;
local permission does not authorize redistribution. The portable source export
excludes those images and their local provenance files. External Apple device-frame
assets likewise remain outside this source package and are never bundled.
